],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"Destinations","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destination"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","title":"Enricher","type":"topic"}}}